# The Python tools CI and `make lint` run outside the agents' venvs. Unversioned on
# purpose: scripts/gen-lockfile.sh locks them into scripts/requirements-tools-frozen.txt
# under the same cooldown as the agents, holding every pin of
# agents/requirements-dev-frozen.txt, so ruff is the version the agents' dev extra
# names (agents/shared/pyproject.toml) and pip-audit is the newest the cooldown allows.
# `make build-tools` builds .venv-tools from that lockfile.
pip-audit
ruff
